    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19210" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">galbănum</span></b> , i, n.
		
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλβάνη</span>
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the
				resinous sap of an umbelliferous plant in Syria</i> (the Bubon
			galbanum, Linn.), <i>galbanum</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 12,
				25, 56, § 121</span></i>; <i><span class="en">24, 5, 13, §
			21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet. Galb. 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 9,
			916</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Calp. Ecl. 5, 89</span></i>.—Also, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">galbănus</span></b> ,
			i, m., <i><span class="en">Vulg. Sir.
				14, 21</span></i>; and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">chalbăne</span></b> , answering to the Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλβάνη</span>, ēs,
				f., <i><span class="en">Dig. 39, 4, 16, § 7</span></i>.</div>
